---
// A small pill naming one thing we do. It is not a control, so it has no hover or focus state.
---

<span class="tag"><slot /></span>

<style>
  /* The radius is half the height of one line, so a tag that has to wrap keeps its round ends. */
  .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-accent);
    border-radius: 1.1em;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: var(--step-small);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>
